# Client API configuration
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT (Expo Go):
#   Leave EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL unset. The app auto-detects your laptop's current
#   LAN IP from Expo/Metro (Constants.expoConfig.hostUri), so it keeps working
#   when your hotspot or Wi-Fi IP changes. The backend runs on port 5000.
#
# MANUAL LOCAL OVERRIDE (optional):
#   Uncomment and set your laptop's current IPv4 (see `ipconfig`) if auto-detect
#   does not work. Get this IP with: ipconfig
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://10.164.109.249:5000
#
# PRODUCTION APK BUILD (must be HTTPS):
#   Set this in client/.env before `eas build` / `expo build`, or add it to the
#   EAS build environment. The trailing "/api" is optional — it is added for you.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
